Package: xmms
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Recommends: unzip
Description: classic skinnable audio player
 XMMS Classic is a maintained preservation fork of XMMS 1.2.11. It keeps the
 classic skinnable interface and plugin architecture usable on current Linux
 and BSD systems while retaining historical runtime identifiers.
 .
 This package includes the player, bundled input and output plugins,
 visualizations, effects, translations, and the Window Maker dock applet.

Package: libxmms-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends:
 libglib2.0-dev,
 libgtk2.0-dev,
 xmms (= ${binary:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends}
Description: development files for XMMS Classic plugins
 Headers, static and shared-library linker files, xmms-config, and the Autoconf
 macro required to build compatible XMMS plugins.
